Stream Motion packet codec
--------------------------
This product vendors and compiles the Stream Motion packet-codec headers from
FANUC's `fanuc_driver` project:

    vendor/fanuc_driver/fanuc_libs/stream_motion/
        include/stream_motion/packets.hpp    (#pragma pack(1) wire structs)
        include/stream_motion/byte_ops.hpp    (endian swap template)

    SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2025-2026, FANUC America Corporation
    SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2025-2026, FANUC CORPORATION
    SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

Only the packet structs and the byte-swap template are used. FANUC's socket
layer (`stream.cpp`, sockpp), `fanuc_client`, and `rmi` libraries are NOT
compiled or linked (see PATCHES.md).

Modifications to the vendored FANUC sources: NONE (as of this release). The
codec is consumed header-only; any future patch is recorded in PATCHES.md with
an SPDX "Modified by" note in the affected file.

